Package: PlasmixProtQC
Title: The package protqc output Quality Control(QC) results of proteomics data for Quartet Project
Version: 1.1.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Yanming", "Xie", email = "yanming.xie@fudan.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Depends: R (>= 3.5)
Imports:
    data.table,
    dplyr,
    flextable,
    ggplot2,
    ggthemes,
    officer,
    psych,
    reshape2,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    xml2
Description: Evaluates Plasmix plasma proteomics data using feature count,
    recall of nominal characteristics, signal-to-noise ratio and Pearson
    correlation with fixed M/F reference ratios. Generates a Word quality report that
    requires all four metrics to exceed the specified 2026 quality thresholds.
